h the Crow Effigy on the bridge overlooking the Cradle of Tranquility to call the Wild God, Jereman."}, [94]={npc="Jereman", tgt="Jereman"}, [95]={npc="Jereman", tgt="Jereman"}, [96]={npc="Jereman", tgt="Jereman"}, [97]={npc="Jereman", tgt="Jereman"}, [98]={npc="Johun Punchy Dillas", tgt="Johun Punchy Dillas"}, [99]={hint="Make skunks leave the area around Johun's equipment without killing them."}, [100]={npc="Johun Punchy Dillas", tgt="Johun Punchy Dillas"}, [101]={npc="Johun Punchy Dillas", tgt="Johun Punchy Dillas"}, [102]={hint="Botín de: Rustleaf Fox"}, [103]={npc="Johun Punchy Dillas", tgt="Johun Punchy Dillas"}, [104]={npc="Johun Punchy Dillas", tgt="Johun Punchy Dillas"}, [105]={npc="Kala'th", tgt="Kala'th", desc="Ve al oeste."}, [106]={npc="Kala'th", tgt="Kala'th"}, [107]={hint="Matar: Predatory Hyjal Stag"}, [108]={hint="Look through the burned buildings in the Cradle of Tranquility for 6 Metal Brackets and 30 Nails and return to Johun \"Punchy\" Dillas in Hyjal."}, [109]={npc="Kala'th", tgt="Kala'th"}, [110]={npc="Marrosis", tgt="Marrosis"}, [111]={npc="Marrosis", tgt="Marrosis"}, [112]={npc="Marrosis", tgt="Marrosis"}, [113]={hint="Matar: Forgotten Soldier, Fleshflay Ravener"}, [114]={hint="Botín de: Fleshflay Ravener, Fleshflayer Ravener"}, [115]={hint="Botín de: Death Wailer, Fleshflay Ravener, Forgotten Soldier"}, [116]={hint="Botín de: Scourge Reanimator"}, [117]={hint="Collect 20 Sun-Bleached Bones."}, [118]={hint="Botín de: Eternal Sentry"}, [119]={npc="Marrosis", tgt="Marrosis"}, [120]={npc="Eluneth", tgt="Eluneth"}, [121]={hint="Botín de: Hyjal Owl, Tainted Hyjal Owl", desc="Un poco al sur de Eluneth; también los sueltan los búhos de Hyjal. Vuelve a Flora Antigua tras recogerlos."}, [122]={npc="Hnaz Blunderflame", tgt="Hnaz Blunderflame"}, [123]={npc="Sefira Everbright", tgt="Sefira Everbright"}, [124]={npc="Sefira Everbright", tgt="Sefira Everbright"}, [125]={npc="Sefira Everbright", tgt="Sefira Everbright"}, [126]={npc="Sefira Everbright", tgt=